    "body": "additionally, I'd love a separate status for plain-old dirty.\r\n\r\nI'm coming from bash-it, where I had my prompt customized to show a green check when there was nothing modified and a red x when there was any modification at all (whether it's something being deleted, renamed, modified or added, one catch-all red x would be displayed), which I prefer over separate indicators for different types of modified.",
