    "updated_at": "2026-02-18T05:10:48Z",
    "body": "I have a related but separate use case which was to show an explicit indicator if the current working tree was clean. I did it with this custom script\n\n```\n[custom.git_clean]\nwhen = \"[[ $(git status --short) == '' ]]\"    \nformat = '[≡](bold green)'\n```\n\nWhich works but has to shell out every time which isn't ideal.",
